* Comparator device sizes: the input pair long enough to keep offset small next to the 3.125 mV LSB, a narrow tail (0.5 um) so the input pair integrates after the clock edge's kick on the DAC plate has settled (4 um gave a 5.5 LSB offset in the converter, 0.25 um left decisions hanging), everything else minimum length.
